!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1	"Five to ten sections (10µm) were cut from each frozen tissue block and collected into a tube with Buffer RLT (Qiagen, Hilden, Germany). Total RNA was extracted using the RNeasy Mini Kit following instructions from the manufacturer (Qiagen). RNA concentrations were measured with a ND-1000 spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies, Wilmington, DE, U.S.A.), and the quality (RNA Integrity Number, RIN) was assessed using the Agilent 2100 Bioanalyzer system (Agilent Biotechnologies, Palo Alto, U.S.A.)."	"Five to ten sections (10µm) were cut from each frozen tissue block and collected into a tube with Buffer RLT (Qiagen, Hilden, Germany). Total RNA was extracted using the RNeasy Mini Kit following instructions from the manufacturer (Qiagen). RNA concentrations were measured with a ND-1000 spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies, Wilmington, DE, U.S.A.), and the quality (RNA Integrity Number, RIN) was assessed using the Agilent 2100 Bioanalyzer system (Agilent Biotechnologies, Palo Alto, U.S.A.)."	"Five to ten sections (10µm) were cut from each frozen tissue block and collected into a tube with Buffer RLT (Qiagen, Hilden, Germany). Total RNA was extracted using the RNeasy Mini Kit following instructions from the manufacturer (Qiagen). RNA concentrations were measured with a ND-1000 spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies, Wilmington, DE, U.S.A.), and the quality (RNA Integrity Number, RIN) was assessed using the Agilent 2100 Bioanalyzer system (Agilent Biotechnologies, Palo Alto, U.S.A.)."	"Five to ten sections (10µm) were cut from each frozen tissue block and collected into a tube with Buffer RLT (Qiagen, Hilden, Germany). Total RNA was extracted using the RNeasy Mini Kit following instructions from the manufacturer (Qiagen). RNA concentrations were measured with a ND-1000 spectrophotometer (NanoDrop Technologies, Wilmington, DE, U.S.A.), and the quality (RNA Integrity Number, RIN) was assessed using the Agilent 2100 Bioanalyzer system (Agile