!Sample_label_protocol_ch1	"For each sample, 2µg of total RNA from each sample was used to prepare biotinylated fragmented cRNA for analysis on Affymetrix Human Genome U133 plus 2 arrays (54675 probe sets, Affymetrix Inc., Santa Clara, U.S.A.). Sample preparation, processing and hybridization were performed according to the GeneChip® Expression Analysis Technical Manual (Affymetrix Inc., Rev. 5)."	"For each sample, 2µg of total RNA from each sample was used to prepare biotinylated fragmented cRNA for analysis on Affymetrix Human Genome U133 plus 2 arrays (54675 probe sets, Affymetrix Inc., Santa Clara, U.S.A.). Sample preparation, processing and hybridization were performed according to the GeneChip® Expression Analysis Technical Manual (Affymetrix Inc., Rev. 5)."	"For each sample, 2µg of total RNA from each sample was used to prepare biotinylated fragmented cRNA for analysis on Affymetrix Human Genome U133 plus 2 arrays (54675 probe sets, Affymetrix Inc., Santa Clara, U.S.A.). Sample preparation, processing and hybridization were performed according to the GeneChip® Expression Analysis Technical Manual (Affymetrix Inc., Rev. 5)."	"For each sample, 2µg of total RNA from each sample was used to prepare biotinylated fragmented cRNA for analysis on Affymetrix Human Genome U133 plus 2 arrays (54675 probe sets, Affymetrix Inc., Santa Clara, U.S.A.). Sample preparation, processing and hybridization were performed according to the GeneChip® Expression Analysis Technical Manual (Affymetrix Inc., Rev. 5)."	"For each sample, 2µg of total RNA from each sample was used to prepare biotinylated fragmented cRNA for analysis on Affymetrix Human Genome U133 plus 2 arrays (54675 probe sets, Affymetrix Inc., Santa Clara, U.S.A.). Sample preparation, processing and hybridization were performed according to the GeneChip® Expression Analysis Technical Manual (Affymetrix Inc., Rev. 5)."	"For each sample, 2µg of total RNA from each sample was used to prepare biotinylated fragmented cRNA fo